00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:10.682
And I was like...

00:09:10.782 --> 00:09:11.683
(LAUGHTER)

00:09:11.783 --> 00:09:13.085
-Really?
-ADAM: Yeah!

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:15.287
I was like, "Did somebody die?"
(LAUGHS)

00:09:15.387 --> 00:09:19.825
My prediction-- my prediction
is it'll go the way it went

00:09:19.925 --> 00:09:21.494
when my friend Woody Harrelson--

00:09:21.594 --> 00:09:23.462
Woody Harrelson
said a number of times

00:09:23.562 --> 00:09:24.530
he was gonna give up pot,

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.298
and then it was always,
"Welcome home, son."

00:09:26.398 --> 00:09:27.266
(LAUGHTER)

00:09:27.533 --> 00:09:29.568
All right. Thank you very much.
We'll see you next week.

00:09:29.668 --> 00:09:30.770
(APPLAUSE)

